-1)^{2}=16?$" 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186125219 1074 "Remember that the equation of a sphere centered at $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ with radius $r>0$ is given by\n\n$$\n(x-{x}_{0})^{2}+(y-{y}_{0})^{2}+(z-{z}_{0})^{2}={r}^{2}.\n$$\n\nBy completing the square for the variable $y$, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+6y+(z-1)^{2} & =16 \\\\ {x}^{2}+({y}^{2}+6y+9)+(z-1)^{2} & =16+9 \\\\ {x}^{2}+(y+3)^{2}+(z-1)^{2} & =25\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write our equation as\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+(y+3)^{2}+(z-1)^{2}={5}^{2},\n$$\n\nwhich gives us a radius of $5.$" 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186125220 1068 #edb/ref 17592186123890 13194139533426 17592186045585 false] [17592186125220 1068 #edb/ref 17592186338718 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186125220 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186125220 1071 "What is the trace in the $xz$-plane of the sphere $(x - 2)^{2} + y^{2} + (z + 2)^{2} = 16$?" 13194139533426 17592186045585 false] [17592186125220 1071 "What is the trace in the $xz$-plane of the sphere $(x-2)^{2}+{y}^{2}+(z+2)^{2}=16?$" 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186125220 1074 "To find the trace in the $xz$-plane, we substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the sphere:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-2)^{2}+(0)^{2}+(z+2)^{2} & =16 \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+(z+2)^{2} & =16\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186129092 1038 #edb/ref 17592186338915 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186129092 1038 #edb/ref 17592186338916 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186129120 1038 #edb/ref 17592186339132 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186129120 1038 #edb/ref 17592186339133 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186129167 1038 #edb/ref 17592186338969 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186129168 1038 #edb/ref 17592186338970 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [17592186129168 1038 #edb/ref 17592186338971 13194139533426 17592186045585 true] [175921861291